@startuml UC5_ManageTeam_Sequence
title UC5 - Manage Team (Sequence Diagram)
note over Player
  **Under Development** — No dedicated TeamScreen exists.
  Team management is currently handled inline:
  - Adding Pokemon: CatchService.ExecuteCapture() adds to Player.PokemonTeam
  - Switching in battle: BattleScreen calls IBattleService.CanSwitchPokemon()
  - Healing: StoryService.HealTeamAtCenter() heals all team members
  A future TeamScreen would allow reordering and box management.
end note

participant "Player" as Player
participant "StoryScreen" as Screen
participant "GameSession" as GS

Player -> Screen: View team (future)
activate Screen

Screen -> GS: Get Player.PokemonTeam
activate GS
GS --> Screen: List<Pokemon> (up to 6)
deactivate GS

Screen --> Player: Display team roster with stats

note over Screen
  Planned features:
  - Swap positions in team
  - View detailed Pokemon stats
  - Release Pokemon
  - Move Pokemon to/from box
  
  Currently not implemented as a
  standalone screen or service.
end note

deactivate Screen
@enduml
